    "layout": "21 x 44 m level hall. Original six-specimen family remains at (10,11). A face/petal/canopy comparison at (10,31) extends the encounter; entrance unchanged, exit now (10,41). Eight-metre outer boundary, open roof, continuous independent floor.",
